<title>JAPAN: Cosel -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Cosel -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to November 20, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.07		vs	    5.77</p>
<p> Operating	    1.03		vs	    1.04</p>
<p> Current		1.13		vs	    1.21</p>
<p> Net		  625    million    vs	  627    million</p>
<p> EPS		   33.43 yen	  vs	   40.20 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     19 million	  vs	  16 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Cosel Co Ltd is a specialised maker of electric switches.</p>
